<div class="page">
  <h1>William Paterson University – Accounts Payable - Invoice Approval Procedure</h1>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="flex: 1; padding-right: 20px;">
      <div class="section-title">"Approve Document" screen:</div>
      <div class="box">
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 10px;">
          <div style="font-weight: bold;">Approve Document</div>
          <div style="width: 100px;"></div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
          <div style="font-weight: bold;">Document Information</div>
          <table class="table-container" style="width: 100%;">
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 30%;">Document Number:</td>
              <td><span data-field="document_number">{{ document_number }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Change Seq#:</td>
              <td><span data-field="change_sequence">{{ change_sequence }}</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Amount:</td>
              <td><span data-field="amount">{{ amount }}</span></td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          <div>
            <div style="font-weight: bold;">Comment:</div>
            <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 5px; min-height: 30px;"><span data-field="comment">{{ comment }}</span></div>
          </div>
          <div style="text-align: right;">
            <button style="padding: 5px 10px;">Approve Document</button>
            <button style="padding: 5px 10px;">Cancel</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 15px; font-size: small;">RELEASE: <span data-field="release_version">{{ release_version }}</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="flex: 1; padding-left: 20px;">
      <div class="box">
        <p>Click "Approve Document" – you will be routed to another screen and must click one more "approve" button to finalize the approval</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="box" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>If you have approved the invoice and your FOAP <span data-field="does_have_enough_budget">{{ does_have_enough_budget }}</span>, you will see a pop-up message saying that the document has been approved.</p>
    <p>If you have approved the invoice but your FOAP <span data-field="does_not_have_enough_budget">{{ does_not_have_enough_budget }}</span>, you will get this message:</p>
  </div>

  <div class="box" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      <input type="checkbox" style="margin-right: 10px;">
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">Document Pending Approval</span>
    </div>
    <p>
      <span data-field="pending_status_message">{{ pending_status_message }}</span>
    </p>
    <button style="padding: 8px 15px; margin-top: 10px;">Continue</button>
  </div>

  <div class="box" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <p>You must resolve the budget issue before the invoice will be paid.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-warning">
    <p>Warning!!!</p>
    <p>If the FOAP does not have sufficient budget you will get a "<span data-field="non_sufficient_funds_message">{{ non_sufficient_funds_message }}</span>" message. It is your responsibility to resolve the budget issue. You can contact your Budget representative to request a transfer or other resolution.</p>
    <p>The invoice will go on hold and will not be paid until the budget matter is resolved.</p>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="page">
  <h1>William Paterson University – Accounts Payable - Invoice Approval Procedure</h1>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="section-title">Additional Tips and Notes:</div>
    <div class="box">
      <p>
        Imaged Document Security<br>
        Imaged Documents can only be viewed while connected to the WPUNJ network. You must either be on campus or connected using the VPN client<br>
        (see <a href="{{ vpn_link }}">{{ vpn_link_text }}</a>)
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>
        Errors Accessing Imaged Documents<br>
        If you receive an error message when attempting to view an imaged document, please contact the Helpdesk to review and resolve the error. They can be reached at <span data-field="helpdesk_phone">{{ helpdesk_phone }}</span> or a Helpdesk ticket can be entered at <a href="{{ helpdesk_url }}">{{ helpdesk_url_text }}</a>
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="box" style="margin-top: 20px;">
      <p>
        Printing Documents<br>
        Right clicking on an imaged document (right click on a PC; Ctrl + click on a Mac) will allow you to either print an imaged document or open the document in a new browser tab for printing.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 80px; font-size: small; text-align: center;">
